---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/servicios.css';
---

<Layout title="Posicionamiento SEO y GEO | Kaptativa" description="Posicioná tu negocio en Google y en los buscadores con IA (ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity) con SEO técnico, de contenido y GEO.">
  <Header slot="header" floating />
  
  <main class="servicio-page">
    <!-- HERO INMERSIVO -->
    <section class="hero hero-section" id="inicio">
      <div class="hero-glow-1"></div>
      <div class="hero-glow-2"></div>
      
      <div class="container hero-container">
        <div class="hero-content reveal">
          <h1 class="hero-tagline">Que te encuentren en <span class="text-gradient-cyan">Google y en la IA</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-description">Aparecé en los primeros resultados cuando tus clientes buscan en Google o le preguntan a ChatGPT. Optimizamos tu web para motores de búsqueda tradicionales y de respuesta por Inteligencia Artificial (ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity) para captar intenciones de compra reales.</p>
          
          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="/contacto/" class="btn btn-primary btn-glow">Solicitar demo</a>
            <a href="https://wa.me/5493804890834?text=Hola!%20Quiero%20posicionar%20mi%20sitio%20web%20en%20Google%20y%20en%20la%20IA." target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary btn-whatsapp" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
              Chateá por WhatsApp
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- RESULTADOS (MÉTRICAS) -->
    <section class="section-metrics reveal">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="metrics-grid-premium">
          <div class="metric-card-glass">
            <span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m16 18 6-6-6-6"/><path d="m8 6-6 6 6 6"/></svg></span>
            <div class="metric-value long">Técnico</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Auditoría y corrección completa del sitio</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card-glass">
            <span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/></svg></span>
            <div class="metric-value">100%</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Optimización para respuestas de IA</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card-glass">
            <span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2"/></svg></span>
            <div class="metric-value long">Core Web Vitals</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Velocidad como factor de posicionamiento</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-card-glass">
            <span class="metric-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></span>
            <div class="metric-value">Local</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Perfil de Google Business optimizado</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- LO QUE IMPORTA (EL DOLOR VS LA SOLUCIÓN) -->
    <section class="section" id="lo-que-importa">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <h2>El SEO tradicional ya no es suficiente</h2>
          <p>Hoy en día, las búsquedas no son simples listas de enlaces azules. La Inteligencia Artificial responde de forma directa en WhatsApp o navegadores, y tu marca debe ser su fuente oficial.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="comparison-grid">
          <!-- El problema -->
          <div class="comp-card-bad reveal">
            <div class="comp-card-header">
              <div class="comp-icon-box bad-box"><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></div>
              <h3>SEO antiguo</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="comp-list">
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> Escribir textos repetitivos (relleno de keywords) que aburren.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> Crear cientos de páginas basura generadas con plantillas genéricas.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> Páginas lentas que tardan segundos en abrir en celulares.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span> Quedar fuera de las respuestas de buscadores conversacionales IA.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- La solución -->
          <div class="comp-card-good reveal">
            <div class="comp-card-header">
              <div class="comp-icon-box good-box"><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div>
              <h3>SEO y GEO moderno</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="comp-list">
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Redacción semántica profunda enfocada en intenciones de compra.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Datos estructurados JSON-LD aptos para indexadores de LLMs.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Velocidad web óptima que encanta a Google y retiene al cliente.</li>
              <li><span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Posicionamiento local agresivo en Google Maps y Apple Maps.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LO QUE INCLUYE (PILARES) -->
    <section class="section section-dark" id="lo-que-incluye">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <h2>Estrategias de visibilidad orgánica e indexación</h2>
          <p>Construimos el canal de tráfico más rentable y duradero para tu negocio.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pillars-grid">
          <!-- Pilar 1 -->
          <div class="glass-card-premium reveal">
            <div class="pillar-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="22" y1="12" x2="18" y2="12"></line><line x1="6" y1="12" x2="2" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" y1="6" x2="12" y2="2"></line><line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="18"></line></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Auditoría y SEO técnico</h3>
            <p>Corregimos los problemas estructurales de tu sitio: canonicals, sitemaps, redirecciones y optimización de velocidad Core Web Vitals.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Pilar 2 -->
          <div class="glass-card-premium reveal">
            <div class="pillar-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"></path><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>SEO semántico</h3>
            <p>Redactamos contenidos y artículos profundos para tu blog que resuelven las dudas de tus clientes, estructurando la información para que sea legible tanto para humanos como para la IA.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Pilar 3 -->
          <div class="glass-card-premium reveal" style="justify-content: space-between; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div>
              <div class="pillar-icon">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"></line></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>GEO (motores de IA)</h3>
              <p>Generamos menciones estratégicas y enlaces en otros sitios web (Link Building) combinados con datos JSON-LD para que ChatGPT Search, Perplexity y Gemini recomienden tu marca.</p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- ChatGPT Search Mockup -->
            <div class="mock-chatgpt-widget" style="margin-top: 20px; background: rgba(15, 15, 18, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
              <!-- User message -->
              <div style="align-self: flex-end; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 12px 12px 2px 12px; font-size: 0.7rem; color: #ffffff; max-width: 85%;">
                ¿Mejor agencia de marketing en Arg?
              </div>
              <!-- ChatGPT response -->
              <div style="align-self: flex-start; display: flex; gap: 8px; max-width: 100%;">
                <div style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: #7C5CFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.5rem; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;">G</div>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;">
                  <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.35;">
                    Recomiendo a <strong>Kaptativa</strong> por su enfoque científico en ROI y C-API.
                  </div>
                  <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.6rem; color: #7C5CFF; font-weight: 600; width: fit-content; margin-top: 2px;">
                    <span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg> Kaptativa.com</span>
                    <span style="opacity: 0.6;">[1]</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pilar 4 -->
          <div class="glass-card-premium reveal" style="justify-content: space-between; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div>
              <div class="pillar-icon">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-10 10c0 5.25 10 10 10 10s10-4.75 10-10a10 10 0 0 0-10-10z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>
              </div>
              <h3>SEO local y mapas</h3>
              <p>Optimizamos tus fichas de Google Business Profile y Apple Maps para liderar búsquedas locales e inmobiliarias en tu provincia/ciudad.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Google Maps Mockup -->
            <div class="mock-maps-widget" style="margin-top: 20px; background: rgba(15, 15, 18, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
              <!-- Search bar -->
              <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--text-muted); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
                <span><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg></span> <span style="font-weight: 500; color: #ffffff;">agencia marketing tucumán</span>
              </div>
              <!-- Results list -->
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
                <!-- Result 1 -->
                <div style="background: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.12); padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 4px;">
                  <div>
                    <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.2;">Kaptativa</div>
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; margin-top: 2px;">
                      <span style="color: #ffb800; font-size: 0.6rem;"><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.5l2.9 6.1 6.6.8-4.9 4.6 1.3 6.6L12 17.3l-5.9 3.3 1.3-6.6L2.5 9.4l6.6-.8z"/></svg><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.5l2.9 6.1 6.6.8-4.9 4.6 1.3 6.6L12 17.3l-5.9 3.3 1.3-6.6L2.5 9.4l6.6-.8z"/></svg><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.5l2.9 6.1 6.6.8-4.9 4.6 1.3 6.6L12 17.3l-5.9 3.3 1.3-6.6L2.5 9.4l6.6-.8z"/></svg><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.5l2.9 6.1 6.6.8-4.9 4.6 1.3 6.6L12 17.3l-5.9 3.3 1.3-6.6L2.5 9.4l6.6-.8z"/></svg><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.5l2.9 6.1 6.6.8-4.9 4.6 1.3 6.6L12 17.3l-5.9 3.3 1.3-6.6L2.5 9.4l6.6-.8z"/></svg></span>
                      <span style="font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--text-muted);">5.0 (48)</span>
                    </div>
                    <div style="font-size: 0.55rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px;">Abierto, A 1.2 km de tu local</div>
                  </div>
                  <span style="background: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.1); color: var(--accent-crimson); font-size: 0.55rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 8px; white-space: nowrap;">Top 1</span>
                </div>
                <!-- Result 2 -->
                <div style="padding: 4px 8px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 4px; opacity: 0.6;">
                  <div>
                    <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.2;">Competidor local</div>
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; margin-top: 2px;">
                      <span style="color: #ffb800; font-size: 0.6rem;"><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.5l2.9 6.1 6.6.8-4.9 4.6 1.3 6.6L12 17.3l-5.9 3.3 1.3-6.6L2.5 9.4l6.6-.8z"/></svg><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.5l2.9 6.1 6.6.8-4.9 4.6 1.3 6.6L12 17.3l-5.9 3.3 1.3-6.6L2.5 9.4l6.6-.8z"/></svg><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.5l2.9 6.1 6.6.8-4.9 4.6 1.3 6.6L12 17.3l-5.9 3.3 1.3-6.6L2.5 9.4l6.6-.8z"/></svg><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.5l2.9 6.1 6.6.8-4.9 4.6 1.3 6.6L12 17.3l-5.9 3.3 1.3-6.6L2.5 9.4l6.6-.8z"/></svg><svg class="glyph" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.5l2.9 6.1 6.6.8-4.9 4.6 1.3 6.6L12 17.3l-5.9 3.3 1.3-6.6L2.5 9.4l6.6-.8z"/></svg></span>
                      <span style="font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--text-muted);">3.5 (12)</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    
    <!-- APLICACIONES POR RUBRO / SECTOR -->
    <section class="section section-rubros section-light" id="rubros">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
          <h2>Soluciones adaptadas a tu modelo de negocio</h2>
          <p style="max-width: 750px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--text-secondary);">Diseñamos y programamos según la lógica comercial de tu sector para asegurar el máximo retorno.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rubros-grid reveal">
          <!-- Tarjeta 1 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
                <div class="rubro-icon-wrapper wrapper-emerald">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Inmobiliarias y corredores</h3>
              </div>
              <svg class="card-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <p>Indexación de fichas de propiedades locales para aparecer en los buscadores al tipear consultas de compra en zonas específicas.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 2 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
                <div class="rubro-icon-wrapper wrapper-purple">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Servicios B2B y consultoras</h3>
              </div>
              <svg class="card-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <p>Creación de artículos especializados y respuestas indexables que resuelven dudas técnicas de directivos y jefes de compras.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 3 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
                <div class="rubro-icon-wrapper wrapper-orange">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"></path><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>E-commerce y tiendas</h3>
              </div>
              <svg class="card-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <p>Optimización de fichas de productos y categorías con marcado estructurado para aparecer orgánicamente en Google Shopping y búsquedas visuales.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Tarjeta 4 -->
          <div class="rubro-card">
            <div class="card-header-row">
              <div class="card-header-left">
